  "title": "Kalshi's First-Ever Lifetime Ban Against George Santos, New York's Suits, and India's Antitrust Laws",
  "summary": "Kalshi imposes a lifetime ban on George Santos, the former U.S. representative, for alleged insider trading. The ban is the first of its kind in the region, with the company citing his failure to cooperate with its investigation. New York sues Kalshi over claims the prediction market is running an illegal gambling operation, following a recent investigation by the Office of the Attorney General. India’s AAI and New Jersey’s antitrust lawsuits, along with New York's suits, highlight the ongoing legal battles surrounding gambling.",
